


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_928ecf02:


    "放学后的教堂。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_ec331f1b:


    "虽然今天是由四人负责扫除，但是现在扫除已经差不多结束，四人正在闲聊中。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_f88fe614:



    voice "2FU_0576"
    fumi "「那个围巾，很适合你呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_441026d5:



    voice "2MI_0568"
    miyako "「谢谢，我也很中意它」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_68d6cac1:



    voice "2RI_0748"
    rin "「说起来从前阵子开始就一直围着啊，发生了什么事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_5e60c7ef:



    voice "2MI_0569"
    miyako "「这是从祥子姐那里收下的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_b2f7deff:


    "听到祥子的名字，阳菜她们三人之间的气氛变得微妙了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_2645870b:



    voice "2MI_0570"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_7fdd0679:



    voice "2FU_0577"
    fumi "「说起祥子姐……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_e8b7a6ae:



    voice "2MI_0571"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_f2bfa64e:


    "圣夜子向右侧耳。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_90aa5303:



    voice "2RI_0749"
    rin "「关于火锅派对的……那晚上」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_129bf9d8:



    voice "2MI_0572"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_43199bc7:


    "这次是向左。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d06ccb49:



    voice "2HI_0734"
    hina "「真是吓了一跳呢。打开门看见圣夜子压在祥子姐肩上」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_250d6ab9:


    "不愧是阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_8e5ea8f2:



    voice "2MI_0573"
    miyako "「那是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_2b1cbe48:



    voice "2HI_0735"
    hina "「睡迷糊了吗？梦见自己变成狮子什么的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_4c5f6e43:



    voice "2MI_0574"
    miyako "「就是突然想恶作剧了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_10172d87:



    voice "2FU_0578"
    fumi "「和祥子姐无关是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_0f39b6d1:



    voice "2MI_0575"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_5bd6bc92:



    voice "2RI_0750"
    rin "「不是她指示你这么说的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_926e46a1:



    voice "2MI_0576"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_911ab078:



    voice "2HI_0736"
    hina "「坏的大人带来了坏的影响啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_647b12ee:


    "大家好过分。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_6e2e6e27:



    voice "2MI_0577"
    miyako "「那个，我……可能是喜欢的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_903850c8:



    voice "2HI_0737"
    hina "「唉？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_03ebbdc9:



    voice "2MI_0578"
    miyako "「喜欢那个人」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d1a50edf:



    voice "2RI_0751"
    rin "「又开玩……呃，认真的吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_79802d99:


    "圣夜子点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_705099d8:



    voice "2FU_0579"
    fumi "「啊—」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_82bbba57:


    "只有文露出了“果然如此”的神情。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_e613e45b:



    voice "2HI_0738"
    hina "「那个喜欢是作为家人的？还是想接吻的那种？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_5b21536a:



    voice "2MI_0579"
    miyako "「想和她接吻呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_90029f28:



    voice "2HI_0739"
    hina "「呜咕……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_85a9f66e:



    voice "2RI_0752"
    rin "「哈哈，等等。稍微冷静一下吧。按欧美那边的思考方式来说家人之间也是会接——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_11686cf0:



    voice "2MI_0580"
    miyako "「像你们两人一样的接吻」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_06808cc9:


    "圣夜子指着相恋的两人。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_75d0e5f8:


    "两人面面相觑。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_b6050680:


    hina_fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_c5f38476:


    hina_rin "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_83c0649a:


    rin_fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_c720319b:



    voice "2RI_0754"
    rin "「原来圣夜夜是肉食系的吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_b79ed39c:


    "伦挠了挠头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_4fa880ba:



    voice "2HI_0741"
    hina "「Blood can't battle吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_92324de9:



    voice "2RI_0755"
    rin "「哈？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_159f00ca:



    voice "2HI_0742"
    hina "「血统是会继承的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_2ebecfb4:



    voice "2RI_0756"
    rin "「噗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_61bc0dce:


    "一如既往的阳式英语。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_7f6420d1:



    voice "2FU_0581"
    fumi "「你们两人是没有血缘关系的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_2ff263ce:



    voice "2MI_0581"
    miyako "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d6674b2a:



    voice "2HI_0743"
    hina "「那就没有问题了啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_8ee73d76:



    voice "2RI_0757"
    rin "「没有……吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_94b6f6fb:


    "应该没有吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_453034c0:



    voice "2RI_0758"
    rin "「年龄差得挺多的哦，圣夜夜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_4019be15:



    voice "2MI_0582"
    miyako "「没问题的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_ed29e200:


    "年龄影响的只是外表。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_4ae1a258:



    voice "2FU_0582"
    fumi "「亲戚们能理解你们吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_25ec7d9b:



    voice "2MI_0583"
    miyako "「没问题的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d2f3bd03:


    "毕竟从一开始就不存在。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_c2a35e02:



    voice "2HI_0744"
    hina "「那个人很色唷？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_f78371db:



    voice "2MI_0584"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，不要紧的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_e6463e07:



    voice "2HI_0745"
    hina "「唔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_98146994:


    "因为，人类就是这样的生物啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_22c3c586:



    voice "2MI_0585"
    miyako "「被那个人触摸的时候就像是触电一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_3f9def63:


    "相恋的二人面面相觑之后接受了，而另一位则是有些无语。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_781c2c0a:



    voice "2HI_0746"
    hina "「哈啊，看来已经下定决心了啊。祥子姐究竟哪里好啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d49596ac:



    voice "2MI_0586"
    miyako "「嗯～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_5edd4278:


    "圣夜子微微歪过头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_13b6a37b:



    voice "2HI_0747"
    hina "「这是需要思考的问题吗！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_dd7e49df:



    voice "2FU_0583"
    fumi "「啊哈哈，很温柔哦。虽然有点色」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_21d0f14c:



    voice "2RI_0759"
    rin "「仔细看的话是个大美人啊。虽然内在是色情大叔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_f9ce999a:



    voice "2HI_0748"
    hina "「嘛，意外的还挺可靠的。虽然很下流」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_50820341:



    voice "2MI_0587"
    miyako "「啊哈哈。这些地方全部都喜欢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_7855a759:


    "三人握住圣夜子的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_3b172a8e:


    hina_rin_fumi "「加油」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_0d919596:



    voice "2MI_0588"
    miyako "「谢谢你们」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_d9feafa7:


    "结果三人还是都选择了支持。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_dd2bf32f:


    "——祥子，被大家喜欢着呢。"




translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_02_c121d6bc:


    "放学后的教堂。"
